{"id":"wb-6-366","name":"佛头寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"佛头寺","text":"佛头寺位于中国山西省平顺县阳高乡车当村村西山坡下高地，浊漳河南岸，俯瞰村落，因寺后山势如佛头而得名。现仅存一座宋代大殿，是一处全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n佛头寺大殿坐北面南，建筑面积131平方米，面阔三间，进深四椽，单檐歇山顶，柱头铺作与补间铺作都是五铺作双下昂，梁架结构为三椽栿对后劄牵用三柱，以蜀柱托平梁。殿顶琉璃脊饰。殿内有元代壁画二十四诸天护法。\n\n2006年5月25日，佛头寺公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位，古建筑类，编号6-366，年代为宋。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BD%9B%E5%A4%B4%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94366568,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94366568","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/701d1e63d4b0422bf6a9caa2.jpg","title":"20260815_Fotou_Temple_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260815_Fotou_Temple_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/70/20260815_Fotou_Temple_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西平顺 佛头寺","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}